                                "sense_id": "3e3ef141-41c6-3608-a843-8fe9da60c713",
                                "text": "With a Dragunov, I can hit any target dead-center at a distanceof two hundred meters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e54ed23-bce2-4f73-b005-de8dc06d3161",
                                "sense_id": "3e3ef141-41c6-3608-a843-8fe9da60c713",
                                "text": "Think of it this way: There's no musical listening experience quite like sitting dead-center in an acoustically perfect concert hall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9550f43c-8363-485d-b23b-39e4fb012dc9",
                                "sense_id": "3e3ef141-41c6-3608-a843-8fe9da60c713",
                                "text": "The snack bar itself had beautiful light-grained Formica counters, and there was a giant popcorn machine placed dead-center as a focal point, like a “Holy Grail” of snacks for all to see."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
